# Play test of Radio Tower Remade (CIPlay radio_tower_remade, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the
# dock (1.45 m) below the tower on the south terrace (2.7 m), its decks at 9, 16 and 23 m, the radio room on the top
# deck's north half, the old shark cage on the seabed south-west.
# RAFT REMADE 10-26: land added round the rock; if the land's centre moved, the offset line below the island line.
island Radio Tower Remade
offset 7.3149 6.0205
expect step 0
expect title Back on the Air

# From the dock up the beach to the tower's foot: the keeper's note
walk 0 -35 to 0 -27 to 0 -24 h=2.6
zone landing
expect step 1
read Keeper's note
expect step 2

# RAFT REMADE 10-26: Keeper's Cove and his diary, Antenna Hill's relay valve (the radio needs it), the secrets
zone keepercove
expect step 3
read Keeper's diary
expect step 4
zone antennafoot
zone antennatop
expect step 5
open Relay mast deck box
expect story valve 1
expect step 6
zone wreckerspoint
expect hidden keepertin
use Beacon lamp 1
use Beacon lamp 3
wait 1
expect shown keepertin
open Keeper's tin
use QSL card 1
use QSL card 2
use QSL card 3
use QSL card 4
use QSL card 5
wait 1
expect message All five QSL cards
expect item TitaniumIngot 1
zone gullcliffs
zone seacave
open Smugglers' cache
open Mail plane's crate
open Trawler's crate
zone jump_rt_finale
open Lineman's tin

# The battery bank, from the cage locker in the old shark cage
open Cage locker
expect story battery 1
expect step 7

# Old Beak on the roof
zone roof
expect message doesn't share
expect step 8
kill Screecher
expect step 9

# Up the tower's three ladders, across the top deck into the radio room
climb 0.5 -22.6 h=2.7
climb -2.5 -22.6 h=9
climb 0.5 -22.6 h=16
expect stand -1 -20 h=23.06
walk 0.5 -20 to 0.5 -15 to 0.5 -10.5 h=23.1
zone radioroom
expect step 10

# The radio on the air: the locker opens
use radio
expect message talks again
expect shown onairlights
expect story battery 0
open Radio room locker
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_Reciever 1
expect item Blueprint_HeadLight 1
expect item Blueprint_Recycler 1
expect done
